WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
If you're on a split-dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.040
Confirm with your written instructions.

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.560
Split dosing means you take the first half of your prep the evening before,

4
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.800
and the second half the morning of your procedure —

5
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.960
typically six hours before your arrival time.

6
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.680
When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second dose

7
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.680
as directed on your prep instructions.

8
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.190
Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until the cutoff time we've

9
00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:21.760
specified.

10
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.280
Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear.

11
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.360
That's how we know your prep is working.

12
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.760
If you have any concerns about how things are going,

13
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.720
call our office first thing in the morning. You're almost done.
